# README
########

This directory contains:

data:      A directory with SQL scripts to populate tablojs initial data
           (settings defaults, dictionaries, reference data).

migration: A directory with SQL scripts to migrate tablojs database from
           one version to another version.
           File naming convention: upgrade_X.Y.Z-X.Y+1.Z.sql

tables:    A directory with all files with CREATE TABLE and index orders.
           One file per table: tablojs_<tablename>.sql
           One file per table for indexes: tablojs_<tablename>.key.sql
